- Please do 2 mouth expressions: mouth open smile and close open smile\n\n[Character Details]\n- Her name is Chia. She is 150cm tall\n- Cute, energetic, mischievous\n- She plays games and do ASMR\n\n[Permission Usage]\n- SNS such as Twitter, Twitch and Youtube!\n- Commercial use such as merchandise\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1uUtynr5vPOjMm4SvzJwOhaN-_s6VJACp?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@rrr97_/works/48", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/31b9a214/uploads/origins/2408e044-0df1-442f-8386-026d8932d37b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=371fcaa8662dc080a1d09586dec77884", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/31b9a214/uploads/origins/2408e044-0df1-442f-8386-026d8932d37b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=371fcaa8662dc080a1d09586dec77884, https://si.imgix.net/31b9a214/uploads/origins/2408e044-0df1-442f-8386-026d8932d37b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d99d729e58d96a92c31032cfb5145ead 2x, https://si.imgix.net/31b9a214/uploads/origins/2408e044-0df1-442f-8386-026d8932d37b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b0f25d947921ba94fc156f641afbc136 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "いつもお世話になっております。\n\n今回はうちの子…分身である\"神凪 四季\"を描いていただこうと思います。\n\n構図や服装などはお任せします。好きなように着せてあげてくださいദി- ̫ -)。\n\n使用用途としましては、アイコンや名刺に使わせて頂こうと思っております。\n\n短い説明で申し訳ございません、よろしくお願いいたしますm(_ _)m\n\n細かい設定\nアホ毛:2本\n髪飾り:大小の黒い花2つ(和服だと外してるかも)\nピアスorイヤリング:右耳に青と緑のドロップ型\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/139YjAsjUZKz81IK8gkPRsYbLsr5bN0ju", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@rrr97_/works/47", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d5d82c14/uploads/origins/1ee90826-90dd-40ba-bfa5-ee46eee74187?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a7fe39fe276637925f0c1933944f1faa", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d5d82c14/uploads/origins/1ee90826-90dd